From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dixonSolutions <203963471+dixonSolutions@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:59:37 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 07/25] contrib: gtactive3wifi: GNOME UI only

The image for this device uses postmarketos-ui-gnome, with
postmarketos-base-ui-gnome-duranium pulled in on Duranium. Panfrost now
works on the device, so drop the software-rendering rationale.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
